From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 07:32:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arifi-sync: lever 10 protected-win entry names its picked sha
 on v0132

HQ85 Q69 linearize: lane 302 lever 10 (33f8ae3037) was picked onto
lane-298/v0132 as 5583912fe8 (patch-id equal, arifi_sync replay-map
MAPPED 1/1 against lane-302/gather-ext). The entry vulkan-moe-gather-
width1-rank-scan-skip now names the picked commit, as release-prep did
for its rebased rows (direct registration, no replay map).

Origin: lane-298
Measured-effect: none (manifest metadata only; no source change)
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
index a27a257b37..0c6deec365 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
@@ -2375,9 +2375,9 @@
     {
       "id": "vulkan-moe-gather-width1-rank-scan-skip",
