+      "_registered": "2026-10-08, lane-302 relaunch-48 (Opus 5.5). Op-level WIN, served LOSSLESS-TIE vs integ 7156c61607; default ON (no switch: dead-code removal, byte-identical). Re-keyed 2026-10-09 by lane 298 relaunch-100 (HQ85 Q69 linearize grant): commit = the pick of 33f8ae3037 onto lane-298/v0132, patch-id equal.",
